395
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:41,000
Butterfly Effect's Divergence

396
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:44,620
This is it?

397
00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:50,050
It's delicious!

398
00:02:50,050 --> 00:02:52,010
Miss Amane, you've never had gyuudon?

399
00:02:52,010 --> 00:02:54,300
No. I'd heard rumors of it.

400
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:55,470
It's delicious.

401
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:59,140
It's even better if you put a raw egg on it.

402
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:00,470
If you call yourself a warrior,

403
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:03,310
you should be able to come to a gyuudon place by yourself.

404
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:10,020
Well, Daru and I come here often.

405
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:12,990
If you invite us, we'll go with you anytime.

406
00:03:13,950 --> 00:03:15,610
I remember!

407
00:03:15,610 --> 00:03:19,200
Last time, I had to pay for Okarin's meal.

408
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,830
It's possible that happened, yes.

409
00:03:21,830 --> 00:03:24,460
It's not just possible! It happened!

410
00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:25,670
Give me back my money!

411
00:03:25,670 --> 00:03:28,540
Sadly, I've none on me today.

412
00:03:28,970 --> 00:03:29,590
It's me.

413
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:33,800
Transfer the funds to my Swiss bank account.

414
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,880
What?

415
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:37,430
The Organization hacked into the Geneva servers?

416
00:03:36,130 --> 00:03:38,220
No cell phones.

417
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:39,550
How terrible...

418
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,600
Um, he's just pretending.

419
00:03:44,210 --> 00:03:46,230
So you were with them, too, Suzu-san?

420
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:48,560
It was time for my lunch break.

421
00:03:48,810 --> 00:03:51,570
If you'd been a bit earlier, you could've joined us.

422
00:03:51,570 --> 00:03:53,780
Then, you want to all go together tomorrow?

423
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:55,360
I'm sure Okarin would be happy to payâ

424
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,240
What?

425
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,700
The Organization's sabotaging the process,

426
00:03:57,700 --> 00:04:00,530
and it will take one week to bring the servers back online?

427
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:01,990
It's Kurisu-chan!

428
00:04:03,250 --> 00:04:05,750
Assistant, did you get some sleep?

429
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:07,210
Don't call me assistant.

430
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,380
Hey, part-timer.

431
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:17,590
If you're done with lunch, get back to work.

432
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,050
What's with her?

433
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,680
A round table?

434
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,140
Indeed.

435
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:26,230
What's that?

436
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,940
A meeting of lab members.

437
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:30,770
We ever do one before?

438
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:33,400
Do you even own a round table?

439
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,570
Not a physical one.

440
00:04:35,570 --> 00:04:38,490
But the round table lies within all lab members' hearts.

441
00:04:38,490 --> 00:04:39,410
Right?

442
00:04:39,410 --> 00:04:41,490
Whether it's true or not,

443
00:04:41,490 --> 00:04:44,910
don't put anything weird in my heart.

444
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:47,540
Do you think there's one in Mayushii's heart, too?

445
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:48,540
Yes, there is.

446
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:50,000
Is there?

447
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,330
Yay!

448
00:04:51,710 --> 00:04:53,340
But what's a round table?

449
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:54,920
Why a round table?

450
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,010
Are you supposed to be King Arthur?

451
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:59,930
I'm only a temporary lab member anyway.

452
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:01,220
At any rate...

453
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:02,760
It's time for a round table.

454
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:07,180
We need to tell Mayuri about the situation we find ourselves in.

455
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:10,140
Situation?

456
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,990
And so,

457
00:05:17,990 --> 00:05:21,530
in order to beat SERN, we must perfect

458
00:05:21,530 --> 00:05:24,120
the Phone Microwave (name subject to change)

459
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:26,200
as soon as possible.

460
